\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerPremouseExtenderSequence}_S(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerPremouseExtenderSequence}_S(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical premouse predicate already supplies the sequence length, extender coherence, amenability, acceptability, and the structure code; the legacy expansion omitted some of these clauses and applied well-foundedness to the tuple rather than its membership relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\vec E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerPremouseExtenderSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerPremouseExtenderSequence}_S(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)","display":true}],"bytes":1116,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2342","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-inner-premouse-extender-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-inner-premouse-extender-sequence]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ab819650b6d5d52d"]}